    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      478.98,
      294.62,
      540.18
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, the Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms do hereby declare under the subsection (1) of the section 5of the Land Acquisition Act that land described below is required fora public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of thatAct.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      553.02,
      294.61,
      626.94
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called \u2018\u2018Winchfieldpark Watta\u2019\u2019 in extent ofabout 12.9745 Hectares, depicted as Lot \u2018\u2018A\u2019\u2019 in the Advance TracingNo. Maha/UDD/2013/1278 prepared by the Superintendent ofSurvey\u2019s Kandy on 25.09.2013, situated in Karambakatiya Villagein Gandeka Korale in Udadumbara Divisional Secretary\u2019s Divisionin Kandy District is bounded as follows;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.49,
      426.9,
      547.23,
      504.9
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot \u2018A\u2019- Winchfieldpark Watta- Extent:12.9745 HectaresNorth: Winchfieldpark Watta claimed by Bank of Ceylon (Kandy)and stream; East: Stream and Winchfieldpark Watta claimed by R.M.Rathnayake; South: Winchfieldpark Watta claimed by R.M.Rathnayake and \u2018\u2018Winchfieldpark Watta\u2019\u2019 claimed by Bank of Ceylon(Kandy); West: Winchfieldpark Watta claimed by Bank of Ceylon(Kandy).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
